 Tips for getting started:

 1. Ask a question about this folder, or ask for a change
 2. Type @ to mention a file, ! to run a shell command, / for commands
 3. Shift+Tab cycles the local guard: ask, auto, plan

╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ > /co                                                                                            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
  /copy             Copy the last answer to the clipboard
  /cost             Show the session's token use
  /config           Settings: theme, editor mode, fullscreen, thinking
  /compact [focus]  Summarise the conversation to free context
  /context          Show how full the context window is
  /resume           Resume a session
